# This is a static frontend — it currently has no build-time environment
# variables, and no secret (AI provider key, GitHub token, etc.) should ever
# be added here with a VITE_ prefix, since anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled
# into client-side JavaScript and becomes publicly visible.
#
# The GitHub stats section calls GitHub's public, unauthenticated REST API
# directly from the browser — no token needed for public data.
#
# The portfolio assistant (src/lib/portfolioAssistant.ts) is intentionally
# not connected to an AI provider yet. When it is, the API key belongs in a
# server-side environment only (e.g. a serverless function's own env vars,
# never this file, never anything shipped to the client):
#
#   ASSISTANT_PROVIDER_API_KEY=
